      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OUR BENSON (1) was favourite last start and led all the way, scoring by 2.5 lengths (22.63) at this track in a Mix 5 over 400m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Can continue on his winning ways. ZATARA'S IMAGE (3) placed last time (17.13) at this track in a Free For All, finishing third and beaten 0.6 lengths. Has already won two times from this draw. Suited here and expected to run well. REIKO BOOM (8) had some strong recent form but was below best last time when fourth (22.87) in a Grade 5 at this track. Generally fast into stride but was shuffled back from the tricky draw last time. Has a good record here at this journey. One of the better hopes. SON OF SPIKE (2) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently.",
